WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.267 --> 00:00:11.187
One fine day, a greedy dog took a walk.

2
00:00:11.188 --> 00:00:13.947
He saw something in the grass.

3
00:00:13.948 --> 00:00:16.627
"Oh! It's a bone!

4
00:00:16.628 --> 00:00:19.678
I love bones!" he said.

5
00:00:19.679 --> 00:00:21.742
"What a lucky day!

6
00:00:21.743 --> 00:00:25.855
Lucky day, lucky day!

7
00:00:25.856 --> 00:00:31.524
Hmm. How will I cook my new bone?" he thought.

8
00:00:31.525 --> 00:00:34.493
"Will I smoke it? No!

9
00:00:34.494 --> 00:00:38.119
Will I boil it? No!

10
00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:42.341
Will I fry it? No way!

11
00:00:42.342 --> 00:00:45.379
I will eat it as it is.

12
00:00:45.380 --> 00:00:50.358
That is the best way to eat a delicious bone.

13
00:00:50.359 --> 00:00:56.478
Lu-lu la-la! Lu-lu la-la!" He danced.

14
00:00:56.479 --> 00:01:01.609
"Oh, what if another dog sees me?" he said.

15
00:01:01.610 --> 00:01:06.117
"No, I will not, I will not share my bone.

16
00:01:06.118 --> 00:01:08.524
It is all mine!

17
00:01:08.525 --> 00:01:12.655
Hmm, where can I hide my bone?"

18
00:01:12.656 --> 00:01:16.584
He looked around and quickly left the park.

19
00:01:16.585 --> 00:01:18.472
He ran and ran.

20
00:01:18.473 --> 00:01:21.790
Finally, he ran onto a bridge.

21
00:01:21.791 --> 00:01:26.308
"Whew! Now my bone is safe," he said.

22
00:01:26.309 --> 00:01:29.199
The greedy dog was very tired.

23
00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:32.761
So he rested on the bridge.

24
00:01:32.762 --> 00:01:35.581
He looked down into the stream.

25
00:01:35.582 --> 00:01:43.121
"Hey! Who is that?" he said.

26
00:01:43.122 --> 00:01:45.717
"That dog has a bone too.

27
00:01:45.718 --> 00:01:49.848
Hmm, his bone is bigger than mine.

28
00:01:49.849 --> 00:01:54.644
And his bone still has meat on it!" he thought.

29
00:01:54.645 --> 00:01:58.284
The greedy dog wanted the other bone too.

30
00:01:58.285 --> 00:02:05.088
"Woof! Woof! Give me that bone!" he said.

31
00:02:05.089 --> 00:02:07.422
"Oh, my bone!

32
00:02:07.423 --> 00:02:10.985
It is gone! Woof! Woof!"

33
00:02:10.986 --> 00:02:13.264
But it was too late.

34
00:02:13.265 --> 00:02:17.361
His bone fell into the deep stream.
